invariant: INV-67
file: src/mldsa_vector.c
catches: test/docker-aes-runtime-qemu.sh mldsa-vector
reason: the lanes' Montgomery multiply subtracts the two doubled high
  halves and does not halve the difference, so every product of the
  NTT, its inverse and the two pointwise products leaves at twice its
  value. Only an arm64 compiler reads the line, and the nightly runs its
  violations on x86-64, so the script builds bin/mldsa_vector_equiv_test
  for arm64 and runs it under qemu-aarch64, where it holds every
  coefficient to both loops. The lane skips without docker, and this
  then reports unguarded rather than caught.

--- old
    return vhsubq_s32(high, low);
--- new
    return vsubq_s32(high, low);
